    "articles": [
      {
        "no": 1,
        "text": {
          "en": "The Supreme People's Court\nReply on Issues Concerning the Application of Article 64 of the Criminal Law\n21 October 2013      Fa No. 229 [2013]\nThe Higher People's Court of Henan Province:\nThe \"Request for Instructions on Issues Concerning the Application of Law to Article 64 of the Criminal Law\" submitted by your court has been received. After study, the reply is as follows:\nIn accordance with the provisions of Article 64 of the Criminal Law and Articles 138 and 139 of the Interpretation of the Supreme People's Court on the Application of the Criminal Procedure Law of the People's Republic of China, where a defendant illegally takes possession of or disposes of the victim's property, the property shall be recovered or the defendant shall be ordered to make restitution or pay compensation in accordance with law. Accordingly, the specific content of the recovery or of the order to make restitution or pay compensation shall be stated in the operative part of the judgment; among which, property already returned to the victim before the judgment shall be noted. Where the victim initiates an incidental civil action, or separately initiates civil litigation requesting the return of property illegally taken possession of or disposed of, the people's court shall not accept the case."
        },
        "noLabel": {
          "en": "Article 1."
        }
      }
    ]
